<title>UK: DSL plans 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond soon - leads.</title>
<headline>DSL plans 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond soon - leads.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSL Finance NV, a unit of DSL Bank, plans to launch a 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond soon, joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and SBC Warburg said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal was expected on January 2 subject to market conditions, and no further details were available, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
